    "cellCounter": 8,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# TypR — 类型化 R 语言\n\nTypR 是 R 语言的类型化超集（Superset），可编译为标准 R 代码。\n它增加了类型注解、类型检查和泛型，同时保持与 R 的完全兼容。\n\n**语法要点：**\n- 语句以分号结尾：`let x <- 42;`\n- 类型化函数使用 `fn(x: int): int { x * x }`\n- TypR 支持变长参数和命名点号，因此 `cat(\"x =\", x);` 可以直接使用。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "let x <- 42;\n# 支持变长参数\ncat(\"x =\", x);",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "typr",
        "name": "basics",
        "lastOutput": "x = 42",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">x = 42</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "# 函数体需要花括号\nlet add <- function(a, b) { a + b };\nlet result <- add(3, 4);\nprint(result);",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "typr",
        "name": "functions",
        "lastOutput": "7",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">7</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "let greeting: char <- \"来自 TypR 的问候！\";\nprint(greeting);",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "typr",
        "name": "typed",
        "lastOutput": "来自 TypR 的问候！",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">来自 TypR 的问候！</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "# 显式的参数和返回类型使函数调用具有静态可检查性\nlet square <- fn(x: int): int { x * x };\nlet result <- square(7);\n# 变长参数可以直接使用\ncat(\"7 的平方 =\", result);",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "typr",
        "name": "square",
        "lastOutput": "7 的平方 = 49",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">7 的平方 = 49</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "# 转发异构命名参数\nlet collect <- fn(...args: Any): [#N, Any] { args };\nlet forward <- fn(...args: Any): [#N, Any] { collect(...args) };\nlet values <- forward(count = 1, enabled = true);\nprint(values);\n@{ base::cat(\"名称:\", base::paste(base::names(values$data), collapse = \", \"), \"\\n\") }@;",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "typr",
        "name": "variadic_forwarding",
        "lastOutput": "typed_vec [2]\n[1] 1\n[2] TRUE\n名称: count, enabled",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">typed_vec [2]\n[1] 1\n[2] TRUE\n名称: count, enabled</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "## 指令\n\n在 TypR 单元格的第一行放置指令：\n\n- `#!source` 保留已命名的带语法高亮的源代码片段，而不编译或执行其内容。纯源码单元格特意不产生 `Out [n]`，并可通过 Notebook VFS 读取。\n- `#!typecheck` 仅对后续代码执行类型检查而不运行。\n- `#!transpile` 显示转译后的 R 输出。\n- `#!show-r` 切换后续 TypR 执行时是否显示生成的 R 代码。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "#!transpile\nlet fib <- fn(n: int): int {\n  if (n <= 1) { n }\n  else { fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2) }\n};\nprint(fib(10));",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "typr",
        "name": "transpile_demo",
        "lastOutput": "\n`fib.integer` <- (function(n) {\nif(n <= 1L |> as.Integer()) {\nn \n} else {\nfib(n - 1L |> as.Integer()) + fib(n - 2L |> as.Integer())\n}\n} |> as.Integer()) |> as.Generic()\n\nprint(fib(10L |> as.Integer()))",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">\n`fib.integer` &lt;- (function(n) {\nif(n &lt;= 1L |&gt; as.Integer()) {\nn \n} else {\nfib(n - 1L |&gt; as.Integer()) + fib(n - 2L |&gt; as.Integer())\n}\n} |&gt; as.Integer()) |&gt; as.Generic()\n\nprint(fib(10L |&gt; as.Integer()))</pre>"
      }
    ]
  }
}